{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-10-75","kind":"proposition","title":"性质与证明：可公度量与截差无理线段与中项无理线段","englishTitle":"If from a medial straight line there be subtracted a medial straight line which is commensurable with the whole in square only, and which contains with the whole a medial rectangle, the remainder is irrational; and let it be called a second apotome of a medial straight line.","book":10,"number":75,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_2.75","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_2.75/","group":"prop_2","sourceNumber":75,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":null}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-10-75@raw-a1392039f9da3abe","contentId":"euclid-10-75","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"a1392039f9da3abe4aa1af3696eded6cc8f9ed4fbfea39087a9a2f32f821aad4","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-10-75.statement","euclid-10-75.proof.1","euclid-10-75.construction.1","euclid-10-75.proof.2","euclid-10-75.proof.3","euclid-10-75.proof.4","euclid-10-75.proof.5","euclid-10-75.proof.6","euclid-10-75.proof.7","euclid-10-75.proof.8","euclid-10-75.proof.9","euclid-10-75.proof.10","euclid-10-75.proof.11","euclid-10-75.proof.12","euclid-10-75.proof.13","euclid-10-75.conclusion","euclid-10-75.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-10-75.statement","contentId":"euclid-10-75","revisionId":"euclid-10-75@raw-a1392039f9da3abe","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"12026120fee666713dc741ffa155918d3edab182570b02bc89fcb4f7324f8543","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"If from a medial straight line there be subtracted a medial straight line which is commensurable with the whole in square only, and which contains with the whole a medial rectangle, the remainder is irrational; and let it be called a second apotome of a medial straight line."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果从中项无理线段中减去中项无理线段,即可公度,整个为正方形,并且包含整个中项无理线段,矩形,则其余为无理;并把它称为中项无理线段,后加截差无理线段。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-75.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-10-75","revisionId":"euclid-10-75@raw-a1392039f9da3abe","order":1,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"4b87eab7c4cf5878a40545f9fbe89980a2b61ee3f415e1458c3421877ff3123e","citations":["euclid-10-28"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For from the medial straight line AB let there be subtracted the medial straight line CB which is commensurable with the whole AB in square only and such that the rectangle AB, BC, which it contains with the whole AB, is medial; [[X. 28](/principles/euclid-10-28)] I say that the remainder AC is irrational; and let it be called a second apotome of a medial straight line."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"从中项无理线段 AB中减去中项无理线段 CB,即可公度,整个AB,仅正方形,因此,它包含的矩形 AB,BC,整个AB,中项无理线段;我说其余的AC是无理;让它称为中项无理线段中第二 截差无理线段。 [[X. 28](/principles/euclid-10-28)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-75.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-10-75","revisionId":"euclid-10-75@raw-a1392039f9da3abe","order":2,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"0200acc1f7e55c4622d706765c0df47c00b013a7029526ebca2acd7f6397fb12","citations":["euclid-2-7"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For let a rational straight line DI be set out, let DE equal to the squares on AB, BC be applied to DI, producing DG as breadth, and let DH equal to twice the rectangle AB, BC be applied to DI, producing DF as breadth; therefore the remainder FE is equal to the square on AC. [[II. 7](/principles/euclid-2-7)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"列出有理线段 DI,DE等于正方形,AB,BC适用于DI,宽度扩大为DG,宽度扩大为矩形,AB,BC等于矩形,宽度扩大为DI,宽度扩大为DF,宽度扩大为DH,宽度扩大为矩形,BC,宽度扩大为2倍;因此,其余FE等于AC,宽度为正方形。 [[II. 7](/principles/euclid-2-7)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-75.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-10-75","revisionId":"euclid-10-75@raw-a1392039f9da3abe","order":3,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"bda77e4512911d24436ab5b6a5e38ee8908704a2811aa2009fd253a93dbdbe65","citations":["euclid-10-15"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Now, since the squares on AB, BC are medial and commensurable, therefore DE is also medial. [[X. 15 and 23, Por.](/principles/euclid-10-15)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"现在,AB正方形,BC中项无理线段和可公度,DE中项无理线段中项无理线段中项无理线段中项无理线段中项无理线段中项无理线段中项无理线段中项无理线段正方形中项无理线段中项无理线段中项无理线段中项无理线段中项无理线段中项无理线段中项无理线段中项无理线段正方形中项无理线段中项无理线段中项无理线段中项无理线段中项无理线段中项无理线段中项无理线段中项无理线段中项无理线段中项无理线段中项无理线段中项无理线段中项无理线段正方形中项无理线段中项无理线段中项无理线段中项无理线段中项无理线段9 [[X. 15 and 23, Por.](/principles/euclid-10-15)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-75.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-10-75","revisionId":"euclid-10-75@raw-a1392039f9da3abe","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"90346117d2378143a9de9fffbc4f9cb411e903566686011bacb4e71170bb4afb","citations":["euclid-10-22"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And it is applied to the rational straight line DI, producing DG as breadth; therefore DG is rational and incommensurable in length with DI. [[X. 22](/principles/euclid-10-22)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"其范围扩大到DG宽,因此,DG长为有理,不可公度长为DI。 [[X. 22](/principles/euclid-10-22)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-75.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-10-75","revisionId":"euclid-10-75@raw-a1392039f9da3abe","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"c62b81b71fd331fb56f7ca67deebf7a5408a07660f68a9583333762ac4b223a9","citations":["euclid-10-23"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Again, since the rectangle AB, BC is medial, therefore twice the rectangle AB, BC is also medial. [[X. 23, Por.](/principles/euclid-10-23)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"同样,由于矩形 AB,BC为中项无理线段,因此是矩形 AB的两倍,BC也是中项无理线段。 [[X. 23, Por.](/principles/euclid-10-23)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-75.proof.5","contentId":"euclid-10-75","revisionId":"euclid-10-75@raw-a1392039f9da3abe","order":6,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"71e1ea55f5d68c487daa7af7081da1026a16f61957ecbf15ea7e7cc2c3c2d731","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And it is equal to DH; therefore DH is also medial."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"等于DH,因此DH也是中项无理线段。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-75.proof.6","contentId":"euclid-10-75","revisionId":"euclid-10-75@raw-a1392039f9da3abe","order":7,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 6","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"0236e9850b4387ff77d9e37fa708ea6b10741029ff795cbafdba84a795a8a2ac","citations":["euclid-10-22"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And it has been applied to the rational straight line DI, producing DF as breadth; therefore DF is rational and incommensurable in length with DI. [[X. 22](/principles/euclid-10-22)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"其范围已扩大到有理线段 DI,宽度扩大为DF;因此,DF是有理,长为不可公度,长为DI。 [[X. 22](/principles/euclid-10-22)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-75.proof.7","contentId":"euclid-10-75","revisionId":"euclid-10-75@raw-a1392039f9da3abe","order":8,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 7","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"beaa190147671bf5d2b3d856532eff9984d95fcfc03fccc1f210219f0b53337b","citations":["euclid-10-11"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And, since AB, BC are commensurable in square only, therefore AB is incommensurable in length with BC; therefore the square on AB is also incommensurable with the rectangle AB, BC. [[X. 11](/principles/euclid-10-11)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"AB,BC是平方可公度而长度不可公度,AB是不可公度,BC,AB也是不可公度,平方可公度而长度不可公度也是不可公度,矩形,AB,BC。 [[X. 11](/principles/euclid-10-11)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-75.proof.8","contentId":"euclid-10-75","revisionId":"euclid-10-75@raw-a1392039f9da3abe","order":9,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 8","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"ab0cc1eadf7f22c207b688894147749c277659b53da7f8a62cecaf9713a6452c","citations":["euclid-10-15","euclid-10-6","euclid-10-13"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But the squares on AB, BC are commensurable with the square on AB, [[X. 15](/principles/euclid-10-15)] and twice the rectangle AB, BC is commensurable with the rectangle AB, BC; [[X. 6](/principles/euclid-10-6)] therefore twice the rectangle AB, BC is incommensurable with the squares on AB, BC. [[X. 13](/principles/euclid-10-13)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但是,AB和BC的正方形和AB的可公度是可公度,矩形和AB的两倍是可公度,矩形和AB的可公度,矩形和BC是2倍,矩形和AB的2倍,BC和不可公度的不可公度是不可公度。 [[X. 15](/principles/euclid-10-15)] [[X. 6](/principles/euclid-10-6)] [[X. 13](/principles/euclid-10-13)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-75.proof.9","contentId":"euclid-10-75","revisionId":"euclid-10-75@raw-a1392039f9da3abe","order":10,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 9","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"9f346c67cc5594d6bdde4b619731cee930ce994de15b5599d2e8f1afe7cfcd3c","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But DE is equal to the squares on AB, BC, and DH to twice the rectangle AB, BC; therefore DE is incommensurable with DH."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但DE等于AB,BC的正方形,BC,DH等于矩形,AB,BC的两倍;因此,DE等于不可公度,DH。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-75.proof.10","contentId":"euclid-10-75","revisionId":"euclid-10-75@raw-a1392039f9da3abe","order":11,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 10","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"930b0c4cb3d2c83ffd34eab76da7bf0c5f3ef2cefc337e3bd3af9e16cab68361","citations":["euclid-6-1","euclid-10-11"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But, as DE is to DH, so is GD to DF; [[VI. 1](/principles/euclid-6-1)] therefore GD is incommensurable with DF. [[X. 11](/principles/euclid-10-11)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但是,DE对DH的比等于GD对DF的比;因此,GD对DF的比是不可公度对DF；DE 与 DH 之比等于 GD 与 DF 之比。 [[VI. 1](/principles/euclid-6-1)] [[X. 11](/principles/euclid-10-11)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-75.proof.11","contentId":"euclid-10-75","revisionId":"euclid-10-75@raw-a1392039f9da3abe","order":12,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 11","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"8cf4631f08e9548b422f170029a4ad3f523b2e7d8741adcf766b9cf07fa9f6dd","citations":["euclid-10-73"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And both are rational; therefore GD, DF are rational straight lines commensurable in square only; therefore FG is an apotome. [[X. 73](/principles/euclid-10-73)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"两者均为有理;因此,GD,DF是有理线段,平方可公度而长度不可公度;因此,FG是截差无理线段。 [[X. 73](/principles/euclid-10-73)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-75.proof.12","contentId":"euclid-10-75","revisionId":"euclid-10-75@raw-a1392039f9da3abe","order":13,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 12","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"766eddd5ec241c7813ec40312d06ee292f15655119955d7f5b901a50c630210d","citations":["euclid-10-20"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But DI is rational, and the rectangle contained by a rational and an irrational straight line is irrational, [deduction from [X. 20](/principles/euclid-10-20)] and its ’side’ is irrational."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"DI是有理,矩形是由有理和无理线段组成的无理,] 其侧面是无理。 [deduction from [X. 20](/principles/euclid-10-20)"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-75.proof.13","contentId":"euclid-10-75","revisionId":"euclid-10-75@raw-a1392039f9da3abe","order":14,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 13","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"312ee7c093e698b2d0431a5cae435f2a7c9f214ed70c24f4731abe48bd5ce8a8","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And AC is the ’side’ of FE; therefore AC is irrational."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"而 AC 是 FE 的边，因此 AC 是无理线段。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-75.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-10-75","revisionId":"euclid-10-75@raw-a1392039f9da3abe","order":15,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"be2a21d074ac766a95368673614fe2c9a821147716bcb003d70a2db016bd6278","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And let it be called a second apotome of a medial straight line. Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"换成中